stages.sampleAnswer:
POST /payments
  Headers: { Idempotency-Key: UUID }
  Body: { customerId, amount, currency, psProvider }
  → 201 { paymentId, status: 'success', pspTxnId } (if PSP responded immediately)
  → 202 { paymentId, status: 'pending', retrievalUrl } (if PSP delayed or down)
  → 409 { error: 'duplicate' } (if same Idempotency-Key with different amount)

GET /payments/:paymentId
  → { paymentId, status, amount, pspTxnId, createdAt, completedAt }
